flowchart LR
  D[Daily observations through t] --> E[One-day forecast error]
  D --> V[Ordinary volatility scale]
  E --> G[Candidate scale correction]
  V --> G
  M[Five-day labels matured by t] --> Q[Quantile of archived normalized errors]
  G --> I[New five-day interval]
  Q --> I
  I --> A[Immutable archive and maturity queue]
  A --> M
